id=mumu-stealth
name=MuMu Stealth
version=1.0.0
versionCode=1
author=Absurdity233
description=Reapplies the environment/root hides on every boot: real-device properties, bind-mounted cpuinfo/DMI/kallsyms/clocksource, and KernelSU's selinux_hide. Runtime state only — nothing is written to the system image.
